+*   $\mathbf{P}_{m+1}, \mathbf{Q}_{m+1}$: Primal and dual projection matrices (implicitly defined or precomputed) [S1, unofficial].
+*   $\tilde{\mathbf{c}}_m, \tilde{\mathbf{d}}_m$: Dual space coefficient vectors.
